This repository is intentionally small: one Vite host, one Pluxel plugin, and one pure domain
package. Pluxel packages are normal registry dependencies; only packages owned by this repository
use `workspace:*`.

## Start

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev
```

The default host is headless. Verify the plugin business route:

```sh
curl http://127.0.0.1:3310/__pluxel/plugins/{{className}}Plugin/api/greeting
```

Run the complete local verification:

```sh
pnpm verify
```

Shared TypeScript, Vite, Vitest, lint, and Pluxel build tooling is owned by the workspace root.
Application packages only declare their direct runtime and test dependencies.

## Layout

- `apps/host`: host-owned static catalog, persistence, management, and deployment policy.
- `plugins/example`: plugin lifecycle, configuration, and business HTTP routes.
- `packages/domain`: framework-independent business logic.

To enable the Pluxel management workbench, change `webManagement: false` in
`apps/host/src/pluxel.static.ts` to a host-owned configuration object. The plugin business route and
domain package do not depend on that optional capability.
